<title>USA: Health Risk Management acquires firm.</title>
<headline>Health Risk Management acquires firm.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Risk Management Inc said Friday its health care claim subsidiary, HRM Claim Management Inc, has acquired Health Program Managers Inc, a third party administrator based in Sacramento, California.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed, but the near-term financial impact is expected to be neutral, Health Risk said.</p>
<p>Health Program Managers has annual revenues of $500,000, Health Risk said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
